<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa Sept cargo load factor higher.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Sept cargo load factor higher.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo said its September cargo load factor rose 1.4 percentage points to 69.1 percent compared with year ago figures.</p>
<p>Details of September included</p>
<p>Freight load factor				  69.1   up  1.4 pct pts</p>
<p>Total freight/post (1,000 tonnes)		142    up  4.2 pct</p>
<p>Available freight-tonne kilometres (million) 797    up  3.4 pct</p>
<p>Revenue freight-tonne kilometres (million)   551    up  5.5 pct</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsdesk Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
